IST, A=Tax Lead, C=Onboarding Ops, I=Process Ops"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1003-V02-S017-02","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1003-V02-S017","Process Step":"Process SPECIALIST review (conditional) - Corporate KYC Remediation - Event Driven","Detail Type":"Routing Rule","Detail Value":"If Correction Required → AOB-PR-1003-V02-S019; if Approved → AOB-PR-1003-V02-S018","Process Step Owner":"Process SPECIALIST","RACI":"R=Process SPECIALIST, A=Tax Lead, C=Onboarding Ops, I=Process Ops"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1003-V02-S017-03","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1003-V02-S017","Process Step":"Process SPECIALIST review (conditional) - Corporate KYC Remediation - Event Driven","Detail Type":"Output","Detail Value":"Record Specialist Review Outcome (Approved / Correction Required)","Process Step Owner":"Process SPECIALIST","RACI":"R=Process SPECIALIST, A=Tax Lead, C=Onboarding Ops, I=Process Ops"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1003-V02-S018-01","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1003-V02-S018","Process Step":"DQ pass gateway - Corporate KYC Remediation - Event Driven","Detail Type":"Gateway Rule (XOR)","Detail Value":"Fail if DQ fails OR Merge Outcome requires remediation OR SPECIALIST correction required; else pass -&gt; AOB-PR-1003-V02-S020","Process Step Owner":"Process Ops","RACI":"R=Process Ops, A=DQ Lead, C=Onboarding Ops, I=Ops Lead"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1003-V02-S019-01","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1003-V02-S019","Process Step":"Remediation loop - Corporate KYC Remediation - Event Driven","Detail Type":"Loop Rule","Detail Value":"Max 3 attempts; SLA: urgent 4h, standard 24h; breach triggers Azure Monitor Alert / Incident Record (Hackathon) escalation; loop to AOB-PR-1003-V02-S011","Process Step Owner":"Onboarding Ops","RACI":"R=Onboarding Ops, A=Ops Lead, C=Process Ops, I=Requestor"},{"PSD ID":"PSD-AOB-PR-1003-V02-S019-02","Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1003-V02-S019","Process Step":"Remediation loop - Corporate KYC Remediation - Event Driven","Detail Type":"Output","Detail Value":"Increment Remediation Att